  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK-granskning Folkh&#xe4;lsomyndigheten</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal control review Public Health Agency of Sweden</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r ett avrop mot ramavtal av revisionstj&#xe4;nster f&#xf6;r en granskning av Folkh&#xe4;lsomyndighetens interna styrning och kontroll (ISK). En ISK-granskning ger Sida ett bra underlag f&#xf6;r beredning av nya insatser och l&#xf6;pande uppf&#xf6;ljning med Folkh&#xe4;lsomyndigheten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a call for tenders for a framework agreement for auditing services for a review of the Public Health Agency of Sweden&apos;s internal control. The system audit review gives Sida a good basis for new appraisals and on-going follow up and dialogue with the Public Health Agency of Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
